            "title": "持續虧損債務沉重 海昌走在崩潰邊緣",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"持續虧損債務沉重 海昌走在崩潰邊緣\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"538\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5d24d9d229cd567d68e476d6bc283e2b5c58d3dfe9466c0c01a2a35bbc73ef6c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fvi%2Fthe_bamboo_works_186%2F628b3114e1defeed5a8a8ea3d44c2c0c\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">持續虧損債務沉重 海昌走在崩潰邊緣</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
